  "prefLabel": "Tra 1001.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-07-05",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 1001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish requirements and set forth the process for pre-qualification of real estate professionals intending to sell state-owned property, the selection of the pre-qualified real estate professionals, as provided in RSA 228:31-b, III, and the sale of the state-owned property.\n\nSource. #8536, INTERIM, eff 1-6-06, EXPIRED: 7-5-06\n\nNew. #10209, eff 10-23-12; ss by #13587, eff 3-22-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra1000.html"
